    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiseera byatuuka abeegeresebwa baaja nga beeyongera obungi. Ghaabaagho obutaisania ghagati w'abayudaaya aboogera Olugureki n'Abayudaaya aboogera Oluyudaaya. Kuba Abayudaaya aboogera Olugureki baali baduuduuma bati banamwandu baibwe baali tibafiibwaku mu ngabania ey'ebyetaago ebyabuliidho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Eikumi n'Ababiri baayeta ekikunsu kyonakyona eky'abeegeresebwa baakoba bati: “Ti kituufu ife okuleka okwegeresa ekibono kya Katonda, twaira ku gwa kugaba mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni baganda bange, mwerondemu abasaadha musanvu abatuufu, abaidhwire Mwoyo Mutukuvu, ab'amagezi, be tughanga okugemya omulimo ogwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ife twidha kusigala ku kusaba na kwegeresa kibono kya Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekidhuubo kino boonaboona baakisemba, baalonda Sitefano, omusaadha aidhwire okwikiriza ni Mwoyo Mutukuvu, ni Filipo, ni Purokoro, ni Nikanori, ni Timoni, ni Parumena, ni Nikolao ow'e Antiokia eyali akyuse n'asoma Ekiyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano baabaleeta y'Abatume abaabasabira ni babaisaaku n'emikono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekibono kya Katonda kyayongera okusansaana, abeegeresebwa beeyongera obungi mu Yerusalemu, ni bakabona kamaala baikiriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitefano ng'aidhwire enkabi n'amaani ga Katonda yaakola ebyewuunhio n'ebyamagero mu bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale abantu abandi ku b'omu sinagoga ey'abaaliku abairu ab'omu Kurene n'ab'omu Alekisanderia, n'abaava mu Kilikia ni mu Asia, baatoolera okutakana ni Sitefano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye tibaamusobola olw'amagezi aga Mwoyo eyamwogererangamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho baaba n'abasaadha, be baapikiriza abaakoba bati: “Twamuwulira ng'avuma Musa ni Katonda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale baasasamaza abantu, n'abakulu ab'ebika, n'Abanamateeka, era baamugema baamuleeta mu lwekobaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamusimbaku abadhulizi abaguya abaakoba bati: “Omusaadha ono talekera kwogera bibono bivumirira kifo kitukuvu n'Amateeka ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba twamuwulira ng'akoba ati: Yesu ow'e Nazarethi aidha kuzikiriza ekifo kino, akyuse n'empisa Musa ye yatwegeresa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo boonaboona abaali batyaime mu lwekobaano bwe baalingirira Sitefano, baabona nga mu maiso ali ng'oti malaika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
